{"id": "5e8ef588-d86c-46bc-865e-14d04b18f861", "slug": "synapse-full-view", "title": "Synapse - Full View", "description": "Synapse Full UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Synapse - Full View\"\ndescription: \"Synapse Full UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#0A1FDB\"\n  secondary: \"#111111\"\n  accent: \"#0A1FDB\"\n  background: \"#F4F4F0\"\n  surface: \"#555555\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#555555\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"1px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Synapse - Full View\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 26; favorites: 15; remixes: 1.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, webgl, effect.\n## Overview\nSynapse Full UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nMARCUS VANCE COGNITIVE / ARCHITECTURE Synapse The spatial mapping of artificial consciousness. NEXUS PUBLISHING LAT: 45.3 LON: -12.4 SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE TOPOLOGY V.2 Mapping the Mind Synapse explores the topological str…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Synapse; Mapping the Mind.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #0A1FDB, secondary #111111, accent #0A1FDB, background #F4F4F0, surface #555555, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Synapse - Full View</title>\n\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"m-0 p-0 w-full min-h-screen md:h-screen md:overflow-hidden bg-[#f4f4f0] text-[#111111] antialiased selection:bg-[#0a1fdb] selection:text-white\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row w-full h-full relative\">\n\n    <!-- Left Panel -->\n    <div class=\"relative flex-1 h-auto min-h-screen md:min-h-0 md:h-full overflow-hidden flex flex-col p-8 md:p-14 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-black/10 box-border\">\n\n        <!-- Container Lines & Corner Squares (Directive) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-8 left-8 w-[1px] bg-black/5 hidden md:block pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-8 right-8 w-[1px] bg-black/5 hidden md:block pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-8 left-8 w-1 h-1 bg-black/20 -translate-x-[1.5px] -translate-y-[1.5px] hidden md:block pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-8 w-1 h-1 bg-black/20 -translate-x-[1.5px] translate-y-[1.5px] hidden md:block pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-8 right-8 w-1 h-1 bg-black/20 translate-x-[1.5px] -translate-y-[1.5px] hidden md:block pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 right-8 w-1 h-1 bg-black/20 translate-x-[1.5px] translate-y-[1.5px] hidden md:block pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#555]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n            <span>MARCUS VANCE</span>\n            <span>COGNITIVE / ARCHITECTURE</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Gradient Border Premium Surface (Directive) -->\n        <div class=\"flex-grow relative mt-10 mb-10 min-h-[50vh] md:min-h-0 rounded-sm\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.12) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 100%); padding: 1px;\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#111] rounded-[1px] overflow-hidden\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 2px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">\n                <canvas id=\"cover-art\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full block\"></canvas>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mt-auto z-10 relative\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-7xl md:text-[5.5rem] font-medium tracking-tight leading-[0.85] mb-4 text-[#111]\">Synapse</h1>\n            <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-[#555] max-w-[400px] leading-relaxed\">The spatial mapping of artificial consciousness.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end mt-10 text-xs tracking-[0.1em] text-[#111]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n            <span>NEXUS PUBLISHING</span>\n            <span class=\"text-[#999]\">LAT: 45.3 LON: -12.4</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Right Panel -->\n    <div class=\"relative flex-1 h-auto min-h-screen md:min-h-0 md:h-full flex flex-col p-8 md:p-14 bg-[#f4f4f0] box-border md:overflow-y-auto\" id=\"right-panel\">\n\n        <!-- Container Lines & Corner Squares (Directive) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-8 left-8 w-[1px] bg-black/5 hidden md:block pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-8 right-8 w-[1px] bg-black/5 hidden md:block pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-8 left-8 w-1 h-1 bg-black/20 -translate-x-[1.5px] -translate-y-[1.5px] hidden md:block pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-8 w-1 h-1 bg-black/20 -translate-x-[1.5px] translate-y-[1.5px] hidden md:block pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-8 right-8 w-1 h-1 bg-black/20 translate-x-[1.5px] -translate-y-[1.5px] hidden md:block pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 right-8 w-1 h-1 bg-black/20 translate-x-[1.5px] translate-y-[1.5px] hidden md:block pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#555]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n            <span>SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE</span>\n            <span>TOPOLOGY V.2</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-normal tracking-tight mt-10 mb-5 text-[#111]\">Mapping the Mind</h2>\n\n        <!-- Text for Masked Reveal (Directive) -->\n        <p class=\"text-base leading-[1.6] text-[#555] m-0 mb-14 max-w-[500px]\" id=\"blurb-text\">\n            Synapse explores the topological structures of neural networks. By visualizing the hidden layers of deep learning models, Vance constructs a geography of machine thought. This edition provides a comprehensive cartography of synthetic reasoning and procedural autonomy.\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"text-[8px] text-black/15 tracking-[4px] mb-14 whitespace-nowrap overflow-hidden select-none\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n            01010011011110010110111001100001011100000111001101100101010011010110000101110000\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mt-auto text-[10px] text-[#555]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n            <div>\n                <ul class=\"list-none p-0 m-0\">\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-black/5 py-2\"><span>FORMAT</span> <span class=\"text-[#111]\">FLEXIBOUND</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-black/5 py-2\"><span>PAGES</span> <span class=\"text-[#111]\">412</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-black/5 py-2\"><span>DIMENSIONS</span> <span class=\"text-[#111]\">145x215MM</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-black/5 py-2\"><span>STOCK</span> <span class=\"text-[#111]\">ARCTIC PAPER</span></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <ul class=\"list-none p-0 m-0\">\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-black/5 py-2\"><span>ISBN</span> <span class=\"text-[#111]\">978-1-42312-88-9</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-black/5 py-2\"><span>PUBLISHER</span> <span class=\"text-[#111]\">NEXUS PRESS</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-black/5 py-2\"><span>PRINTED IN</span> <span class=\"text-[#111]\">GERMANY</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-black/5 py-2\"><span>TYPEFACE</span> <span class=\"text-[#111]\">INTER & MONO</span></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end mt-14\">\n            <div style=\"height: 48px; width: 160px; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(to right, #111 0, #111 2px, transparent 2px, transparent 5px, #111 5px, #111 6px, transparent 6px, transparent 10px, #111 10px, #111 14px, transparent 14px, transparent 16px);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"text-xs text-[#111]\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">$42.00 USD</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n// WebGL Animation Initialization\nfunction initWebGL() {\n    const canvas = document.getElementById('cover-art');\n    if (!canvas) return;\n    const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl', { alpha: false, antialias: true });\n    if (!gl) return;\n\n    const resizeCanvas = () => {\n        const rect = canvas.parentElement.getBoundingClientRect();\n        const dpr = window.devicePixelRatio || 1;\n        canvas.width = rect.width * dpr;\n        canvas.height = rect.height * dpr;\n        gl.viewport(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n    };\n    window.addEventListener('resize', resizeCanvas);\n    resizeCanvas();\n\n    const vsSource = `\n        attribute vec4 aVertexPosition;\n        void main() {\n            gl_Position = aVertexPosition;\n        }\n    `;\n\n    // Modified Shader for new visual variant\n    const fsSource = `\n        precision highp float;\n        uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n        uniform float u_time;\n\n        void main() {\n            vec2 st = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_resolution.xy;\n            st.x *= u_resolution.x / u_resolution.y;\n\n            vec2 pos = st * 75.0; // Increased density\n            vec2 gridId = floor(pos);\n            vec2 gridUv = fract(pos) - 0.5;\n\n            float t = u_time * 0.4;\n            float n1 = sin(gridId.x * 0.12 + t) * cos(gridId.y * 0.18 - t * 0.7);\n            float n2 = sin(gridId.x * 0.22 - t * 0.9) * cos(gridId.y * 0.08 + t * 1.3);\n            float field = (n1 + n2) * 0.5;\n\n            float radius = (field * 0.5 + 0.5) * 0.48;\n            float dist = length(gridUv);\n            float shape = step(radius, dist);\n\n            float blockNoise = fract(sin(dot(floor(gridId / 6.0), vec2(23.1406,89.522))) * 43758.5453);\n            if (blockNoise > 0.85) {\n                shape = 1.0 - shape;\n            }\n\n            vec3 paperColor = vec3(0.05, 0.05, 0.05);\n            vec3 inkColor = vec3(0.9, 0.25, 0.05); // Vibrant structural orange\n\n            vec3 finalColor = mix(inkColor, paperColor, shape);\n            gl_FragColor = vec4(finalColor, 1.0);\n        }\n    `;\n\n    function compileShader(gl, type, source) {\n        const shader = gl.createShader(type);\n        gl.shaderSource(shader, source);\n        gl.compileShader(shader);\n        return shader;\n    }\n\n    const vertexShader = compileShader(gl, gl.VERTEX_SHADER, vsSource);\n    const fragmentShader = compileShader(gl, gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER, fsSource);\n\n    const shaderProgram = gl.createProgram();\n    gl.attachShader(shaderProgram, vertexShader);\n    gl.attachShader(shaderProgram, fragmentShader);\n    gl.linkProgram(shaderProgram);\n\n    const positions = new Float32Array([-1,1, 1,1, -1,-1, 1,-1]);\n    const positionBuffer = gl.createBuffer();\n    gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, positionBuffer);\n    gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, positions, gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n\n    const vertexPosition = gl.getAttribLocation(shaderProgram, 'aVertexPosition');\n    gl.enableVertexAttribArray(vertexPosition);\n    gl.vertexAttribPointer(vertexPosition, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n\n    const resLoc = gl.getUniformLocation(shaderProgram, 'u_resolution');\n    const timeLoc = gl.getUniformLocation(shaderProgram, 'u_time');\n\n    function render(now) {\n        gl.useProgram(shaderProgram);\n        gl.uniform2f(resLoc, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n        gl.uniform1f(timeLoc, now * 0.001);\n        gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP, 0, 4);\n        requestAnimationFrame(render);\n    }\n    requestAnimationFrame(render);\n}\n\n// GSAP Masked Word Reveal Initialization\nfunction initScrollReveal() {\n    const blurb = document.getElementById('blurb-text');\n    if(blurb && typeof gsap !== 'undefined') {\n        const text = blurb.innerText;\n        // Wrap words for masked reveal\n        blurb.innerHTML = text.split(' ').map(word =>\n            `<span style=\"overflow:hidden; display:inline-block; vertical-align:top; margin-right:0.25em;\"><span class=\"reveal-word block\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">${word}</span></span>`\n        ).join('');\n\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        const isDesktop = window.innerWidth >= 768;\n        const scroller = isDesktop ? '#right-panel' : window;\n\n        gsap.to('.reveal-word', {\n            y: '0%',\n            duration: 0.85,\n            ease: 'power3.out',\n            stagger: 0.015,\n            scrollTrigger: {\n                trigger: blurb,\n                scroller: scroller,\n                start: 'top 90%',\n            }\n        });\n    }\n}\n\nwindow.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n    initWebGL();\n    initScrollReveal();\n});\n</script>\n\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "synapse-full-view.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/synapse-full-view.jpg", "source_name": "synapse-full-view-DESIGN.md", "views": 86, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T05:51:43.769579+00:00"}